=== QR Factorization Exception Summary ===
Phase 8 discovered exceptions in cuSOLVER's geqr2 QR factorization kernels
at κ >= 1000 (well-conditioned regime).

Exception types detected:
- [div0]: Division by zero in reciprocal square root (RSQ64H)
- [NaN]: NaN propagation from invalid operations (sqrt negative, etc)
- [infinity]: Overflow to infinity in QR preprocessing

These occur in double-precision workspace (geqr2_smem_domino_fast type f64)
but do NOT prevent convergence of the iterative refinement algorithm.
